<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-TRO Learning downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-TRO Learning downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrington Research Associates analyst Alexander Paris Jr. said he downgraded TRO Learning Inc to a long-term buy from a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Until we become more comfortable with management's ability to execute in this new environment, we've decided to take a more conservative stance with our estimates,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>-- He said the company is guiding analysts to reduce earnings expectations for fiscal 1997 to &quot;perhaps as low as $0.50 per share&quot; from previous expectations of near $0.90 per share.  The company reported earnings of $0.15 per share in fiscal 1996 ended October 31.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the educational software company closed Tuesday in over-the-counter trading at 9-1/2.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
